"- [Pauli twirling](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pauli-twirling) - totuși, [measurement twirling cu TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex) *este* acceptat.\n"
